WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.085
Local AI keeps selected processing close to users and private data.

00:00:04.085 --> 00:00:08.600
It can provide low network latency, offline capability, direct control over versions,

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.335
and predictable availability after hardware is purchased.

00:00:11.335 --> 00:00:14.995
These strengths suit confidential document review, local coding assistance,

00:00:14.995 --> 00:00:18.280
edge inference, and routine workloads that fit existing systems.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.410
Cloud capacity complements those limits.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.360
A team can burst to larger GPUs for a temporary job,

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:26.040
call a model with capabilities unavailable locally,

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.775
or serve remote users without distributing high-end hardware.

00:00:28.775 --> 00:00:32.525
Shared cloud services can support collaboration and centralized operations.

00:00:32.525 --> 00:00:34.840
The benefit appears when the cloud role is defined,

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.150
not when every request is sent remotely by default.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.560
Hybrid designs can also provide alternatives.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.310
If a local server is unavailable,

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:44.221
an approved cloud service may preserve non-sensitive workflows.

00:00:44.221 --> 00:00:46.785
If a hosted API fails or reaches a rate limit,

00:00:46.785 --> 00:00:49.070
a local model may provide reduced capability.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:53.080
Redundancy is real only when clients, authentication, model behavior,

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.075
and data policy support the alternate path.

00:00:55.075 --> 00:00:58.960
A fallback that cannot accept the same data is not a transparent substitute.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:03.170
Using both environments reduces dependence on a single architecture but adds integration

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:04.055
and operations.

00:01:04.055 --> 00:01:09.000
Teams must manage model differences, APIs, identities, network paths, logs, cost,

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.785
and version drift.

00:01:09.785 --> 00:01:13.075
Adopt hybrid placement where the combined value exceeds that complexity.

00:01:13.075 --> 00:01:16.790
The aim is to use local control and cloud flexibility selectively,

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:19.040
while preserving a coherent service for users.
